function bossCourseQuestionKey(question){return [Number(question?.stage),String(question?.prompt||''),String(question?.concealedPrompt||question?.displayChallenge||question?.q||'').replace(/<[^>]*>/g,''),String(question?.a||'')].join('\u241f');}
function bossCoursePool(stage,source=questions){const target=Number(stage),seen=new Set();return (Array.isArray(source)?source:[]).filter(question=>{if(!question||Number(question.stage)!==target||!question.id)return false;if(typeof questionAllowedForSession==='function'&&!questionAllowedForSession(question))return false;if(target<2&&!kanaFromQuestion(question))return false;const key=bossCourseQuestionKey(question);if(seen.has(key))return false;seen.add(key);return true;});}
function bossQuestionIdsForAttempt(stage,source=questions,random=Math.random){const pool=bossCoursePool(stage,source).slice();for(let i=pool.length-1;i>0;i--){const roll=Math.max(0,Math.min(.999999999,Number(random())||0)),j=Math.floor(roll*(i+1));[pool[i],pool[j]]=[pool[j],pool[i]];}return pool.slice(0,BOSS_QUESTION_TARGET).map(question=>String(question.id));}
function bossQuestionForProgress(battle,source=questions){const id=battle?.questionIds?.[Math.max(0,Number(battle.questions)||0)];return id?(Array.isArray(source)?source:[]).find(question=>String(question.id)===String(id)&&(typeof questionAllowedForSession!=='function'||questionAllowedForSession(question)))||null:null;}
function beginBossAttempt(battle){clearBossAutoAdvance();const questionIds=bossQuestionIdsForAttempt(battle.stage);battle.questions=0;battle.correct=0;battle.questionIds=questionIds;battle.failureReason='';battle.finishedAt=0;battle.finishReason='';battle.reward=0;battle.rewardClaimed=false;if(questionIds.length!==BOSS_QUESTION_TARGET){setBossFailure(battle,'This course does not yet contain 25 different boss questions.');battle.startedAt=0;battle.deadline=0;return false;}globalThis.speechSynthesis?.cancel?.();const now=Date.now();battle.status='active';battle.startedAt=now;battle.deadline=now+BOSS_TIME_LIMIT_MS;return true;}
function showBossResults(){clearBossAutoAdvance();save();render();renderBossHud();openV5('boss');}
function finishBossAttempt(battle,reason='completed',finishedAt=Date.now()){if(!battle||battle.status!=='active')return false;if(reason==='completed'&&bossChallengePassed(battle,finishedAt))return completeBossChallenge(battle,finishedAt);battle.status='failed';battle.finishedAt=finishedAt;battle.finishReason=reason;const summary=bossResultSummary(battle,finishedAt);battle.failureReason=reason==='timeout'?`Time expired. ${summary.correct}/${BOSS_QUESTION_TARGET} correct and ${summary.answered}/${BOSS_QUESTION_TARGET} answered.`:`Test complete. ${summary.correct}/${BOSS_QUESTION_TARGET} correct. A perfect score is required to unlock the next mine.`;showBossResults();return false;}
function showNextBossQuestion(battle=state.v5?.boss){if(!battle||battle.status!=='active')return false;const now=Date.now();if(now>=battle.deadline){finishBossAttempt(battle,'timeout',now);return false;}const question=bossQuestionForProgress(battle);if(!question){setBossFailure(battle,'The randomized boss question deck could not continue. Please retry the challenge.');showBossResults();return false;}state.selectedStage=battle.stage;const prepared={...question,opts:Array.isArray(question.opts)?shuffle([...question.opts]):question.opts,bossCourseStage:battle.stage,silentTesting:true};state.active=prepared;state.answered=false;state.shieldArmed=false;showQuestion(prepared);setMessage(`Boss question ${battle.questions+1} of ${BOSS_QUESTION_TARGET} · randomized from the full ${stages[battle.stage].label} course · silent test.`,'');render();return true;}
function completeBossChallenge(battle,completedAt=Date.now()){if(!bossChallengePassed(battle,completedAt))return false;const stage=battle.stage,bounty=Math.round((25000+stage*20000)*(1+companionEffect('bossReward'))),firstVictory=!state.v5.bossDefeated.includes(stage);battle.status='passed';battle.finishedAt=completedAt;battle.finishReason='completed';battle.failureReason='';battle.reward=bounty;if(firstVictory){state.v5.bossDefeated.push(stage);state.v5.bossWins++;}if(!battle.rewardClaimed){battle.rewardClaimed=true;rewardNuggets(bounty);showChest(bounty);}setMessage(`${BOSSES[stage]} defeated with 25/25 correct within 5 minutes! +${bounty.toLocaleString()} Nuggets.`,'correct');showBossResults();return true;}
function season(){const m=new Date().getMonth()+1;if(m===12||m<=2)return{key:'winter',name:'Snow Lantern Festival',icon:'❄️',desc:'Complete five correct answers for a winter treasure.',color:'#8edcff'};if(m>=3&&m<=5)return{key:'sakura',name:'Sakura Festival',icon:'🌸',desc:'Practice beneath the blossoms for a seasonal treasure.',color:'#ff9fca'};if(m>=6&&m<=8)return{key:'matsuri',name:'Summer Matsuri',icon:'🎆',desc:'Celebrate summer study with festival rewards.',color:'#ffd166'};return{key:'yokai',name:'Yokai Night',icon:'👻',desc:'Brave the autumn mine for a mysterious treasure.',color:'#c89cff'};}
function updateSrs(q,correct){
 if(!q?.id)return;const old=state.v5.srs[q.id]||{interval:0,ease:2.3,reps:0};
 if(correct){old.reps++;old.interval=old.reps===1?1:old.reps===2?3:Math.min(60,Math.max(1,Math.round(old.interval*old.ease)));old.ease=Math.min(3,old.ease+.05);}else{old.reps=0;old.interval=.08;old.ease=Math.max(1.3,old.ease-.2);}
 old.dueAt=Date.now()+old.interval*DAY;old.last=Date.now();old.correct=!!correct;state.v5.srs[q.id]=old;
}
function collectWord(q){
 if(!q)return;const jp=stripMarkup(q.displayChallenge||q.q||'');if(!/[ぁ-んァ-ヶ一-龯]/.test(jp))return;
 const id=q.id||jp;const card=state.v5.wordBook[id]||{jp,reading:'',meaning:'',seen:0,mastery:0};card.seen++;card.mastery=Math.min(100,card.mastery+8);card.meaning=/[ぁ-んァ-ヶ一-龯]/.test(String(q.a))?(q.help?stripMarkup(q.help):q.prompt):String(q.a);card.tutor=card.tutor||tutorQuestion(q);card.curriculum=q.curriculum||card.curriculum||'standard';card.updated=Date.now();state.v5.wordBook[id]=card;
}
function chestRewardAmount(stage=selectedStageIndex()){const index=Math.max(0,Math.min(CHEST_REWARD_BY_STAGE.length-1,Number(stage)||0)),base=CHEST_REWARD_BY_STAGE[index],forgeBonus=buildingLevel('forge')*.04;return Math.round(base*(1+forgeBonus+companionEffect('chestReward')));}
function chestReward(){const amount=chestRewardAmount();rewardNuggets(amount);state.v5.chests++;state.v5.missions.chests=Number(state.v5.missions.chests||0)+1;state.v5.lastChestAt=Date.now();showChest(amount);}
function showChest(amount){let el=document.getElementById('v5Treasure');if(!el){el=document.createElement('div');el.id='v5Treasure';el.className='v5-treasure';document.body.appendChild(el);}el.innerHTML=`<div class="v5-chest">🎁</div><strong>Treasure found!</strong><span>+${amount.toLocaleString()} Nuggets</span>`;el.classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>el.classList.remove('show'),2200);}
function react(kind){document.querySelectorAll('.miner-avatar').forEach(a=>{a.dataset.reaction=kind;setTimeout(()=>{if(a.dataset.reaction===kind)delete a.dataset.reaction;},1100);});}
function decorateCharacters(){ensureV5();document.querySelectorAll('.miner-avatar').forEach(a=>{if(a.closest('.choice-avatar-preview,.fashion-avatar-preview'))return;a.dataset.jacket=state.v5.fashion.jacket;a.dataset.gloves=state.v5.fashion.gloves;a.dataset.shoes=state.v5.fashion.shoes;});let pet=document.getElementById('v5CompanionFloat');const companion=COMPANIONS.find(x=>x.id===state.v5.companion);if(companion&&companion.id!=='none'){if(!pet){pet=document.createElement('button');pet.id='v5CompanionFloat';pet.className='v5-companion-float';pet.onclick=()=>openShop('companions');document.body.appendChild(pet);}pet.textContent=companion.icon;pet.title=companion.name;}else pet?.remove();document.querySelectorAll('.character-preview-card,.menu-avatar-pane').forEach(card=>{let display=card.querySelector('.character-companion-display');if(!companion||companion.id==='none'){display?.remove();card.classList.remove('has-equipped-companion');return;}card.classList.add('has-equipped-companion');if(!display){display=document.createElement('button');display.type='button';display.className='character-companion-display';display.onclick=()=>{if(typeof closeGameMenu==='function')closeGameMenu();openShop('companions');};card.appendChild(display);}display.innerHTML=`<span>${companion.icon}</span><strong>${companion.name.replace(/ the .*/, '')}</strong><small>Companion</small>`;display.title=`${companion.name}: ${companion.bonus}`;display.setAttribute('aria-label',`Equipped companion: ${companion.name}. Open companions shop.`);});}
window.refreshJapaneseMinerCompanionDisplays=decorateCharacters;

